<title>UK: World Bank sets 100 million rand one-year bind.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 100 million rand one-year bind.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.0	MATURITY    10.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   90 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
